cannot be certified. The independent image check establishes the printed sequence; it does not establish that the mark is accidental, editorial, or replaceable with τ.", "suggested_revision": "Keep this locus blocked. Obtain evidence explaining “-ὰ” from the edition's typographic or editorial conventions and relevant apparatus or print context. If “τὰ χρῄζοντα” remains the proposed correction, distinguish it explicitly from the supplied reading rather than presenting it as established. Any resulting English replacement must undergo fresh review. The other disclosed marks before “ναῦται” and “ἐγρηγορὼς” should likewise remain classified as unresolved typographic or editorial features, not asserted OCR errors.", "severity": "blocking"}]}]}
